00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.000
Er, well...

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.160
I have an idea.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:14.200
Depending on my sacred sword "wing" level,
it's possible to enhance my flight ability.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.410
Right now I'm still at a low level,

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:20.540
but I think I can at least get through
the people outside instantly.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.290
So, um...

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:25.830
I...

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:29.620
I want you to kiss me.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.620
U-understood.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:39.540
Hooray! I can finally kiss Takuma-kun, too.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:43.540
I heard that the first kiss tastes like lemon,
but is it really true?

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.620
This is my first kiss...

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.410
Takuma-kun, can you bend down a bit more?

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.410
H-hold on a second...

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:58.250
Whaaaaaa

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:58.250
There's too much of a height difference
and I can't reach his lips!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.000
Wh-wh-what do we do?!

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:08.200
Takuma-kun, will you unbutton your shirt?

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:11.870
MUTSUMI-chan is in here! MUTSUMI-chan is-

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.700
Is that all you can say?!

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:18.290
I've lost sight of her but she has to be around here!

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.200
You sure you weren't just seeing things?

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:24.160
Well... I did see a girl running away.

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:28.250
And those giant tits... It had to be MUTSUMI-chan!

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.580
No way the guy she was with could be her boyfriend...

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.000
If he is, there's gonna be a bloodbath!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:44.500
When kissing your lover, the conditions for
invocation differ depending on location.

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:48.000
If we're kissing on the lips, then the transformation
will happen instantaneously,

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.580
but the further away from the lips we go,
the more time it takes to transform.

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:58.830
min
sec
min
min
min

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:58.830
Anatomical Kiss Chart

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:54.160
The cheek takes five seconds,

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.700
and the chest takes three minutes...

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:59.160
the nape of the neck should take about
one minute of kissing before I can transform!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.750
This together with the heat is making my head spin.

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:08.450
Calm down... Times like this...

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.330
can be used to study!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:12.950
Dangerous
Takuma-kun's
Mental Scenery
Study study
Emergency
Gotta study

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:13.250
Take a deep breath, fix your posture,

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.660
and start off with math!

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.450
Commence review!!
Commence review!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:19.160
Ow!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.410
T...Takuma-kun? You're stepping on my foot.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.410
Square root of two equals 1.41421356...

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:28.160
Square root of 5 equals 2.2360679...

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:31.830
His face looks more serious than usual...

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:36.750
I get it! This is encouragement for me
to focus more and kiss him!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:40.700
I'm sorry, Takuma-kun, I'll try even harder!

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.750
Hey was she over there?

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.700
She's gotta be over there!

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:54.120
Hey, there's something caught over there.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.500
Where the hell is "over there?"

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:57.120
Look, at that locker.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.330
We're dead!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.830
MUTSUMI-chan is over there!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.500
So this is how I die, huh?

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.000
My mom is probably gonna be disappointed in Heaven.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.830
After all, I'm probably headed to Hell...

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:11.620
I don't wanna die!

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:14.700
There's only twenty seconds left so calm down!

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:17.040
Takuma-kun is scared...

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:20.500
That's understandable.
He does have a fear of people.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:23.330
Even if he didn't have that, it'd still be scary.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.580
But even so...

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:26.790
He still helped me.

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:31.750
He could have easily run away by himself,
but didn't let go of my hand.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:34.580
Not only did he encourage me,

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:37.500
but he gave me such a sweet treat...

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.580
Takuma-kun...

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.330
I love you.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.950
Ten seconds to go!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.250
Nine, eight, seven...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.160
six, five, four...

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:55.250
three...!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.790
Oh no, we're not gonna ma-

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:04.290
What is that? A spear?

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:05.790
"Kiss with a lover"

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.080
"Kiss with a lover"...

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:08.290
Valkyrie invoked

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:07.700
Valkyrie invoked!

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.910
What was that gust of wind?!

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:17.330
This is just a space for cleaning supplies!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.410
Sixth Valkyrie
"Helmwige"
Wing Lv. 6

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.250
It's okay now.

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.660
Relax, we're floating.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:40.250
It feels like our date was a success, but...

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:43.750
I'm leaving Takuma-kun with
so many bad memories of today.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:46.870
Even though he wanted to get home
I was unreasonable and stopped him from leaving.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.370
We were chased around because of that, and...

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:53.200
I was just trying to make fun memories for him.

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:02.580
It's beautiful.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:09.160
A long time ago, back when that shopping mall
was built, my mom and I came here to play.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.580
All day long we went to different stores,

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:16.660
and we played and ran around and fell,
and ate delicious things...

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:19.500
and we finished the day
watching the sunset from the roof.

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:22.290
The sunset I saw that day looks just like this one.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:23.750
Takuma-kun...

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:27.040
I'm so glad you're happy!

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:29.250
It felt really good whe...

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.580
I had fun!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.120
Yeah...

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:35.580
Wh-what happened?

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:40.200
Um... Since I'm at a low level I may have
already reached my flight limit.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.200
Huh?!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.330
Good grief.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.410
How long do I have to play
bodyguard for this weakling?

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:52.910
Thanks to you, Big Sister Ichika,
we can focus on dating.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:55.160
I'm truly grateful to you.

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:58.700
Hmph. That's also my mission. I'll be patient.

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:01.580
By the way, can you come to the campus festival?

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:06.080
Everyone besides Shino who has not yet
recovered will be a part of it.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:08.250
I don't care about that weakling,

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:12.160
but in order to protect my beloved sisters,
I will also participate.

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:17.290
I felt a strange presence today.

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:18.660
Stay alert.

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.450
The enemy was approaching a few seconds ago.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:25.290
So they do have a bodyguard following them.

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:29.370
I was right not to head straight for them.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:34.450
But this is delicious. I can't just throw this meal out.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.330
I'm going to shoot you, you mutt.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:43.040
Well, well. You've come too, have you?

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:45.620
How long are you going to slack off?

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:48.500
Do you understand the gravity of your mission?

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:51.500
How about you hurry up and dispose of the Valkyries?

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:56.950
With all due respect,
my meal has not yet been prepared.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:59.160
Now is the time to enjoy my appetizers.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.500
Would you like to have some too?

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:04.200
The food here is fairly good.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:07.540
Fenrir has also sent a miserable coward, huh?

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:09.000
Relax.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.120
There's a campus festival coming soon.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:16.750
That place in particular will be the ideal
hunting ground to devour all of the Valkyries!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:25.000
Val Love, "Date with a Valkyrie Idol," successful.

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:27.120
Experience Points acquired.

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:29.830
Helmwige Level Up, confirmed.

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:35.910
Date Complete

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:34.500
Date complete.

00:23:07.660 --> 00:23:09.120
Thank you, Itsuyo-chan!

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:12.870
Thanks to everyone's support, I leveled up, too!

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:15.450
I think I can be useful in combat now!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.830
It's natural that an older sister
would worry over her younger sister.

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:21.080
But we're triplets...

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:23.660
You like to stress the
older sister thing sometimes, huh?

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:25.790
It's good your Val love was so simple.

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:27.370
Natsuki said the same thing.

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:31.500
As long as you weren't found by your fans and/or
get stuck in a locker, it was probably a snap.

00:23:31.500 --> 00:23:35.700
Y-you're right, it'd be really rough
if those things happened, huh?

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:36.700
Mutsumi?

00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:40.910
Next time: The Serving Maiden

00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:39.200
Next time: "The Serving Maiden."
